        "person" : "A giant owl on top of Frost Bank Tower",
        "action" : "answering every question in court with nothing but ‘Who?’",
        "object" : "the bank's vault paying out just compensation",
        "notes" : "Fifth Amendment: a grand jury for serious crimes, no double jeopardy, no one forced to testify against himself, due process of law, and just compensation for property taken. The owl face on top of Frost Bank Tower is hauled into court and answers every question with nothing but ‘Who?’, pleading the Fifth, while the bank below pays just compensation for everything the city takes."
